这一轮想分清什么？</h2><p class="stage-explanation-caption">登记的问题与目的 · 研究 Agent 原文</p><p class="stage-question">brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</p><div class="stage-reading-path" aria-label="本轮阅读顺序"><span><b>01</b> 问题</span><span><b>02</b> 预测与实测</span><span><b>03</b> 判断变化</span><span><b>04</b> 后续行动</span></div><div class="stage-source-row"><span><button type="button" class="stage-source-link">计划登记 #63</button></span><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,border-color,color] duration-150 ease-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/40 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.97] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 select-none hover:bg-accent/70 hover:text-accent-foreground h-8 rounded-sm px-3 text-xs" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-search mr-1 size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M4.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 1.727 1H18a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3"></path><path d="m9 18-1.5-1.5"></path><circle cx="5" cy="14" r="3"></circle></svg>查看原始证据</button></div></header><div class="stage-round-status" role="note"><span>已登记 · 尚无落地结果</span><span>尚无关联的判断变更记录</span><span>记录可追溯 ≠ 科学结论已验证</span></div><section class="research-probe-product min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-background" aria-label="P2 实验产物"><div class="px-5 py-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h4 class="text-sm font-medium">预测与实测</h4><p class="mt-1 text-[11px] te