y-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H1</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">◐ 收窄</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化恢复可用性的瞬态电流（T型钙样或 Ih 样）：超极化条件刺激解除失活/激活该电流，释放后在去极化测试期产生额外内向驱动，使测试期峰数显著高于裸细胞基线（15.3±噪声）。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H2</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">? 有争议</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向 K 流（适应型）：去极化条件刺激激活它，压制后续测试反应；超极化条件刺激后测试反应不高于基线。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H3</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效应集中在基线通道的慢 Na 失活动力学，slow_na=true），即放电表观变化全部可由基线通道解释，无需额外反弹电流。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H4</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_reboun…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_rebound 存在小电导（g≈0.05-0.15）的弱内向电流（Ih 样或弱 T 型样），超极化恢复其可用性，释放后提供适度内向驱动——足以解释 P1 观测 17.33 相对基线 15.33 的 +2.0 弱增强，但不足以达到 H1 的强反弹带 [18,30]。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H5</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T 型钙样瞬态流（快 m 激活 + 快 h 失活恢复，h_tau≈40ms），40ms 超极化即充分恢复可用性，释放时产生瞬态爆发驱动——预测 brief hyperpol 40ms 协议显著增强（+4 以上），而慢 Ih 样 flavour 在该协议无效应。</span></button></div></div></div></section></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R1b:-trigger-matrix" id="radix-:R1b:-content-matrix" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 m-0 data-[state=inactive]:hidden"><section class="research-panel p-4" aria-label="证据矩阵"><h2 class="mb-4 text-[13px] font-semibold">假设与证据</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-max min-w-full border-collapse text-[12px]"><thead><tr class="text-left text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><th class="sticky left-0 z-10 bg-card py-1 pr-2 font-normal">假设（派生）</th><th class="py-1 pr-2 font-normal">状态</th><th class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 font-normal"><button type="button" class="hover:underline">P1（3 次）</button></th><th class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 font-normal"><button type="button" clas