t border-border bg-muted/20 px-5 py-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-medium">这一轮改变了什么</h4><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-muted-foreground">尚未记录假设状态的变化。图中的区间比较不会自动生成科学判断。</p></footer></section><section class="stage-next" aria-label="后续行动"><div class="stage-explanation-kicker"><span>04 / 后续行动</span><span>按当前回放时点显示</span></div><h3>此时尚无后续实验登记</h3><p>不把建议当作已执行，也不从后来的报告补写下一步。</p></section><details class="stage-boundary"><summary>来源与解释边界</summary><p>本页按记录整理，不重新判断科学真伪。预测区间不是置信区间；落入区间不等于假设成立。</p><p>选择理由：这里只展示登记的问题与目的，尚未接入独立的“为什么优先选择它”字段。没有记录的理由不补写。</p><p>局限：上述判断理由保留 Agent 原文，本页未做独立科学审查；未单列的限制不代表不存在。</p></details></article><details class="workbench-feedback"><summary>实验如何迭代 <span>查看一次反馈改变</span></summary><ul class="space-y-2 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><li>P1 → P2</li><li>原协议：hyperpol conditioning + depol test (-30 uA/250 ms, then +12 uA)；实测 17.33（3 次），落在 H3 的预测区间</li><li>因此：H1 → ◐ 收窄、H2 → ? 有争议</li><li>新协议：brief hyperpol conditioning + test (-30 uA/40 ms, then +12 uA)；目的：brief hyperpol 40ms 协议下真细胞 spike_count（reps=1）：ref/slow_na 校准 13.0、weakIh 校准 17.0、weakT 校准 20.0——三分 H3（无额外效应）/ H4（弱内向，慢 Ih flavour）/ H5（弱内向，快 T flavour）。</li></ul></details></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R1b:-trigger-map" id="radix-:R1b:-content-map" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 m-0 data-[state=inactive]:hidden"><section class="research-panel p-4" aria-label="假设与证据"><h2 class="mb-2 text-[13px] font-semibold">假设与证据</h2><p class="mb-4 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">派生关系未记录</p><div class="research-hypothesis-grid" role="group" aria-label="假设派生图"><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H1</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">◐ 收窄</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是净内向、超极化恢复可用性的瞬态电流（T型钙样或 Ih 样）：超极化条件刺激解除失活/激活该电流，释放后在去极化测试期产生额外内向驱动，使测试期峰数显著高于裸细胞基线（15.3±噪声）。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H2</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">? 有争议</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">ca_rebound 的额外电流是活动依赖的外向 K 流（适应型）：去极化条件刺激激活它，压制后续测试反应；超极化条件刺激后测试反应不高于基线。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H3</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">额外电流对常规步进与超极化释放协议无显著影响（效应集中在基线通道的慢 Na 失活动力学，slow_na=true），即放电表观变化全部可由基线通道解释，无需额外反弹电流。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H4</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_reboun…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H1 的 SCOPED 变体：ca_rebound 存在小电导（g≈0.05-0.15）的弱内向电流（Ih 样或弱 T 型样），超极化恢复其可用性，释放后提供适度内向驱动——足以解释 P1 观测 17.33 相对基线 15.33 的 +2.0 弱增强，但不足以达到 H1 的强反弹带 [18,30]。</span></button></div></div><div class="research-hypothesis-branch"><div><button type="button" class="research-hypothesis-node" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px]"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-mono text-muted-foreground">H5</span><span class="text-muted-foreground">○ 未定</span></span><span class="block text-[13px] font-medium leading-relaxed">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T…</span><span class="mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">H4 的快瞬态 flavour：弱内向电流是 T 型钙样瞬态流（快 m 激活 + 快 h 失活恢复，h_tau≈40ms），40ms 超极化即充分恢复可用性，释放时产生瞬态爆发驱动——预测 brief hyperpol 40ms 协议显著增强（+4 以上），而慢 Ih 样 flavour 在该协议无效应。</span></button></div></div></div></section></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="horizontal" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R1b:-trigger-matrix" id="radix-:R1b:-content-matrix" tabindex="0" class="ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 m-0 data-[state=inactive]:hidden"><section class="research-panel p-4" aria-label="证据矩阵"><h2 class="mb-4 text-[13px] font-semibold">假设与证据</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-max min-w-full border-collapse text-[12px]"><thead><tr class="text-left text-[11px] text-muted-foreground"><th class="sticky left-0 z-10 bg-card py-1 pr-2 font-normal">假设（派生）</th><th class="py-1 pr-2 font-normal">状态</th><th class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 font-normal"><button type="button" class="hover:underline">P1（3 次）</button></th><th class="whitespace-nowrap py-1 pr-2 font-normal"><button type="button" class="hover:underline">P2（1 次）</button></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=